{"design":{"context":"视频暂停在蓝衣男子右手刚接住篮球、左手辅助扶稳的动态持球瞬间。小游戏不读取、操作或追踪原片人物与像素，而是在半透明界面中绘制持球动作示意、蓝色人物轮廓、绿色目标区和可拖拽篮球。玩家控制的是新增的自绘篮球标记，用于模拟接球后的球位微调；蓝色人物的姿态变化仅是游戏反馈，不代表对原片动作的识别或复刻。","goal":"在总计 8 秒内把自绘篮球的球心拖入绿色椭圆目标区，使篮球达到右肩前方、双臂弯曲、重心居中的标准持球预备位，从而完成一次快速稳位。","screen":"容器内采用纵向自适应布局：顶部为标题、状态和倒计时；中部为主要操作舞台，占据剩余空间并保持透明背景；舞台上以半透明线条绘制居中的蓝衣人物轮廓，绿色虚线椭圆位于人物右肩前方的左上侧，橙色篮球标记初始位于人物胸腹右上方；底部是操作提示和当前结果提示。目标区尺寸随容器变化，篮球位置使用舞台宽高的相对比例计算。","input":"玩家仅能按下并拖动自绘橙色篮球标记，使用 Pointer Events 同时支持鼠标、触屏和手写笔。按下后进入进行状态并捕获指针；移动时篮球标记跟随指针且被限制在舞台内。抬起时根据球心与目标椭圆的位置判定。pointercancel、指针被系统取消或按下后未移动即抬起均立即失败；每次小游戏只接受一次有效尝试。","rules":"总时限为 8 秒，从小游戏挂载后开始，准备等待时间也计入总时限。篮球初始球心位于舞台坐标约 (0.58, 0.44)，目标椭圆中心约为 (0.45, 0.30)，因此主要操作方向为向左上方微移。目标区实际大小取自适应渲染后的绿色椭圆矩形。释放时计算球心相对目标中心的归一化横纵距离 dx、dy，dx=球心横坐标与目标中心横坐标之差除以目标半宽，dy 同理除以目标半高；dx²+dy²≤1 即命中，边界 1 属于成功，否则失败。命中后立即结束，不再要求额外停顿；按住后释放但球心在区外属于未命中；按下后移动距离不足 4 像素便释放属于过早释放并失败；超过 8 秒仍未完成属于过晚并失败；pointercancel 同样失败。所有失败均结束本次尝试，不提供第二次机会。","states":"准备：显示人物示意、篮球、目标区和 8 秒倒计时，允许玩家首次按下篮球，进行等待已计入总时限。进行：首次有效按下后进入，篮球跟随指针移动，倒计时继续。成功：球心进入目标椭圆后显示绿色光晕与“稳住”状态，并以 success 调用一次 api.finish。失败：未命中、过早释放、pointercancel 或超时后显示红色提示，篮球轻微弹跳，并以 failure 调用一次 api.finish。结束：宿主显示反馈 1 秒后恢复原片；本小游戏不产生剧情分支。","feedback":"成功时绿色目标区产生扩散光晕，篮球标记呈绿色高亮，并显示“稳住！已进入标准持球预备位”；交给宿主的反馈文字为“稳住！篮球已进入右肩前方的标准持球区域。”失败时目标区熄灭，篮球轻微弹跳并显示失败原因；由交互手势触发的失败会尝试播放约 180 毫秒的低频合成失衡短音，浏览器不允许音频时仅保留视觉反馈。宿主负责显示成功或失败文案 1 秒，结束后原片继续。","timeout_s":8},"javascript":"function mount(container, api) {
  if (!container || !api || typeof api.finish !== 'function') {
    if (api && typeof api.reportError === 'function') api.reportError('挂载接球稳位小游戏失败：缺少有效容器或 api.finish。');
    return { destroy() {} };
  }

  const TOTAL_MS = 8000;
  const root = document.createElement('div');
  root.className = 'sg-root is-ready';
  root.setAttribute('role', 'application');
  root.setAttribute('aria-label', '接球稳位小游戏');

  const hud = document.createElement('div');
  hud.className = 'sg-hud';
  const titleWrap = document.createElement('div');
  titleWrap.className = 'sg-title-wrap';
  const title = document.createElement('div');
  title.className = 'sg-title';
  title.textContent = '接球稳位';
  const stateText = document.createElement('div');
  stateText.className = 'sg-state';
  stateText.textContent = '按住篮球，拖向左上方的绿色目标';
  titleWrap.appendChild(title);
  titleWrap.appendChild(stateText);
  const timer = document.createElement('div');
  timer.className = 'sg-timer';
  timer.textContent = '8.0s';
  hud.appendChild(titleWrap);
  hud.appendChild(timer);

  const stage = document.createElement('div');
  stage.className = 'sg-stage';

  const figure = document.createElement('div');
  figure.className = 'sg-figure';
  figure.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'true');
  const head = document.createElement('span');
  head.className = 'sg-head';
  const torso = document.createElement('span');
  torso.className = 'sg-torso';
  const armA = document.createElement('span');
  armA.className = 'sg-arm sg-arm-a';
  const armB = document.createElement('span');
  armB.className = 'sg-arm sg-arm-b';
  const legs = document.createElement('span');
  legs.className = 'sg-legs';
  figure.appendChild(head);
  figure.appendChild(torso);
  figure.appendChild(armA);
  figure.appendChild(armB);
  figure.appendChild(legs);

  const target = document.createElement('div');
  target.className = 'sg-target';
  target.style.left = '45%';
  target.style.top = '30%';
  const targetLabel = document.createElement('span');
  targetLabel.className = 'sg-target-label';
  targetLabel.textContent = '右肩前';
  target.appendChild(targetLabel);

  const guide = document.createElement('div');
  guide.className = 'sg-guide';
  guide.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'true');

  const ball = document.createElement('div');
  ball.className = 'sg-ball';
  ball.style.left = '58%';
  ball.style.top = '44%';
  ball.setAttribute('aria-label', '可拖拽篮球标记');

  stage.appendChild(figure);
  stage.appendChild(guide);
  stage.appendChild(target);
  stage.appendChild(ball);

  const footer = document.createElement('div');
  footer.className = 'sg-footer';
  const instruction = document.createElement('div');
  instruction.className = 'sg-instruction';
  instruction.textContent = '拖动橙色篮球，让球心落入绿色椭圆';
  const result = document.createElement('div');
  result.className = 'sg-result';
  result.setAttribute('aria-live', 'polite');
  result.textContent = '准备中';
  footer.appendChild(instruction);
  footer.appendChild(result);

  root.appendChild(hud);
  root.appendChild(stage);
  root.appendChild(footer);
  container.appendChild(root);

  let state = 'ready';
  let finished = false;
  let destroyed = false;
  let activePointerId = null;
  let moved = false;
  let startX = 0;
  let startY = 0;
  let deadline = Date.now() + TOTAL_MS;
  let timeoutId = 0;
  let intervalId = 0;
  let audioContext = null;
  const bindings = [];

  function bind(node, type, handler, options) {
    node.addEventListener(type, handler, options);
    bindings.push([node, type, handler, options]);
  }

  function setBallPosition(clientX, clientY) {
    const rect = stage.getBoundingClientRect();
    if (!rect.width || !rect.height) return;
    const radius = ball.offsetWidth * 0.5;
    const x = Math.max(radius + 4, Math.min(rect.width - radius - 4, clientX - rect.left));
    const y = Math.max(radius + 4, Math.min(rect.height - radius - 4, clientY - rect.top));
    ball.style.left = ((x / rect.width) * 100).toFixed(3) + '%';
    ball.style.top = ((y / rect.height) * 100).toFixed(3) + '%';
  }

  function updateTimer() {
    if (finished) return;
    const remaining = Math.max(0, deadline - Date.now());
    timer.textContent = (remaining / 1000).toFixed(1) + 's';
    timer.classList.toggle('is-urgent', remaining <= 2000);
    if (remaining <= 0) fail('操作超时，未能在 8 秒内完成持球稳位。');
  }

  function releaseActivePointer() {
    if (activePointerId !== null) {
      try {
        if (ball.hasPointerCapture(activePointerId)) ball.releasePointerCapture(activePointerId);
      } catch (error) {
        if (api && typeof api.reportError === 'function') api.reportError('释放拖拽指针失败：' + String(error));
      }
      activePointerId = null;
    }
    ball.classList.remove('is-dragging');
  }

  function playFailureTone() {
    const AudioCtor = window.AudioContext || window.webkitAudioContext;
    if (!AudioCtor) return;
    try {
      if (!audioContext) audioContext = new AudioCtor();
      if (audioContext.state === 'suspended') audioContext.resume().catch(() => {});
      const now = audioContext.currentTime;
      const oscillator = audioContext.createOscillator();
      const gain = audioContext.createGain();
      oscillator.type = 'triangle';
      oscillator.frequency.setValueAtTime(155, now);
      oscillator.frequency.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(105, now + 0.18);
      gain.gain.setValueAtTime(0.0001, now);
      gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.045, now + 0.015);
      gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.0001, now + 0.2);
      oscillator.connect(gain);
      gain.connect(audioContext.destination);
      oscillator.start(now);
      oscillator.stop(now + 0.2);
    } catch (error) {
      // 音频为可选反馈，不影响玩法判定。
    }
  }

  function endGame(outcome, message) {
    if (finished || destroyed) return;
    finished = true;
    state = outcome;
    releaseActivePointer();
    window.clearTimeout(timeoutId);
    window.clearInterval(intervalId);
    root.classList.remove('is-ready', 'is-running');
    root.classList.add(outcome === 'success' ? 'is-success' : 'is-failure');
    if (outcome === 'success') {
      stateText.textContent = '稳住！已进入标准持球预备位';
      result.textContent = '成功';
      result.className = 'sg-result is-success';
    } else {
      stateText.textContent = message;
      result.textContent = '未稳住';
      result.className = 'sg-result is-failure';
      playFailureTone();
    }
    try {
      api.finish({ result: outcome, message: message });
    } catch (error) {
      if (typeof api.reportError === 'function') api.reportError('结束接球稳位小游戏失败：' + String(error));
    }
  }

  function fail(message) {
    if (finished) return;
    endGame('failure', message);
  }

  function onPointerDown(event) {
    if (finished || (state !== 'ready' && state !== 'running')) return;
    if (event.isPrimary === false) return;
    if (typeof event.button === 'number' && event.button !== 0) return;
    event.preventDefault();
    if (activePointerId !== null) return;
    if (state === 'ready') {
      state = 'running';
      root.classList.remove('is-ready');
      root.classList.add('is-running');
      stateText.textContent = '微调球心位置，松开完成判定';
      result.textContent = '拖拽中';
      result.className = 'sg-result';
    }
    activePointerId = event.pointerId;
    moved = false;
    startX = event.clientX;
    startY = event.clientY;
    ball.classList.add('is-dragging');
    try {
      ball.setPointerCapture(event.pointerId);
    } catch (error) {
      if (typeof api.reportError === 'function') api.reportError('无法捕获拖拽指针：' + String(error));
      fail('当前设备无法捕获拖拽操作。');
    }
  }

  function onPointerMove(event) {
    if (finished || state !== 'running' || event.pointerId !== activePointerId) return;
    event.preventDefault();
    const distance = Math.hypot(event.clientX - startX, event.clientY - startY);
    if (distance >= 4) moved = true;
    setBallPosition(event.clientX, event.clientY);
  }

  function onPointerUp(event) {
    if (finished || state !== 'running' || event.pointerId !== activePointerId) return;
    event.preventDefault();
    releaseActivePointer();
    if (!moved) {
      fail('操作过早：尚未移动篮球便已松开。');
      return;
    }
    const ballRect = ball.getBoundingClientRect();
    const targetRect = target.getBoundingClientRect();
    const ballCenterX = ballRect.left + ballRect.width / 2;
    const ballCenterY = ballRect.top + ballRect.height / 2;
    const targetCenterX = targetRect.left + targetRect.width / 2;
    const targetCenterY = targetRect.top + targetRect.height / 2;
    const halfWidth = targetRect.width / 2;
    const halfHeight = targetRect.height / 2;
    if (halfWidth <= 0 || halfHeight <= 0) {
      fail('目标区域尺寸异常，无法完成判定。');
      return;
    }
    const dx = (ballCenterX - targetCenterX) / halfWidth;
    const dy = (ballCenterY - targetCenterY) / halfHeight;
    const distanceSquared = dx * dx + dy * dy;
    if (distanceSquared <= 1 + 1e-6) {
      endGame('success', '稳住！篮球已进入右肩前方的标准持球区域。');
    } else {
      let reason = '球心尚未进入绿色目标区域。';
      if (dy > 0.2) reason = '球位偏低，需要向左上方调整。';
      else if (Math.abs(dx) > 0.3) reason = '球位左右偏离，需要重新对准目标。';
      fail(reason + ' 本次稳位失败。');
    }
  }

  function onPointerCancel(event) {
    if (event.pointerId !== activePointerId) return;
    releaseActivePointer();
    fail('拖拽操作被取消，未能完成持球稳位。');
  }

  bind(ball, 'pointerdown', onPointerDown, { passive: false });
  bind(ball, 'pointermove', onPointerMove, { passive: false });
  bind(ball, 'pointerup', onPointerUp, { passive: false });
  bind(ball, 'pointercancel', onPointerCancel, { passive: false });

  timeoutId = window.setTimeout(() => fail('操作超时，未能在 8 秒内完成持球稳位。'), TOTAL_MS);
  intervalId = window.setInterval(updateTimer, 100);
  updateTimer();

  return {
    destroy() {
      if (destroyed) return;
      destroyed = true;
      finished = true;
      window.clearTimeout(timeoutId);
      window.clearInterval(intervalId);
      releaseActivePointer();
      for (const item of bindings) {
        item[0].removeEventListener(item[1], item[2], item[3]);
      }
      bindings.length = 0;
      if (audioContext) {
        const closing = audioContext.close();
        if (closing && typeof closing.catch === 'function') closing.catch(() => {});
        audioContext = null;
      }
      if (root.parentNode === container) container.removeChild(root);
    }
  };
}","css":"#game { color: #f8fafc; width: 100%; height: 100%; position: relative; overflow: hidden; background: transparent; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif; }
#game, #game * { box-sizing: border-box; }
#game .sg-root { width: 100%; height: 100%; min-height: 260px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; padding: clamp(10px, 2.5vw, 20px); color: #f8fafc; user-select: none; -webkit-user-select: none; touch-action: none; }
#game .sg-hud { flex: 0 0 auto; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; padding: 10px 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.25); border-radius: 14px; background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.58); box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(2, 6, 23, 0.18); }
#game .sg-title-wrap { min-width: 0; }
#game .sg-title { font-size: clamp(17px, 3vw, 23px); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
#game .sg-state { margin-top: 3px; color: #cbd5e1; font-size: clamp(12px, 2.4vw, 15px); line-height: 1.35; }
#game .sg-timer { flex: 0 0 auto; min-width: 66px; padding: 8px 10px; border-radius: 10px; text-align: center; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; color: #e0f2fe; background: rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.2); border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.35); }
#game .sg-timer.is-urgent { color: #fee2e2; background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.28); border-color: rgba(248, 113, 113, 0.5); animation: sg-timer-pulse 0.6s ease-in-out infinite alternate; }
#game .sg-stage { position: relative; flex: 1 1 auto; min-height: 205px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.2); border-radius: 18px; background: radial-gradient(circle at 55% 54%, rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.16), rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.3) 58%, rgba(2, 6, 23, 0.12)); box-shadow: inset 0 0 34px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.24); touch-action: none; }
#game .sg-stage::after { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 7%; right: 7%; bottom: 9%; height: 1px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.3), transparent); pointer-events: none; }
#game .sg-figure { position: absolute; z-index: 1; left: 56%; top: 54%; width: 112px; height: 180px; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); opacity: 0.55; pointer-events: none; }
#game .sg-head { position: absolute; left: 39px; top: 0; width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 50%; border: 3px solid #93c5fd; background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.18); }
#game .sg-torso { position: absolute; left: 27px; top: 34px; width: 60px; height: 76px; border: 3px solid #60a5fa; border-radius: 18px 18px 12px 12px; background: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.24); transform: rotate(-4deg); }
#game .sg-arm { position: absolute; top: 48px; width: 58px; height: 18px; border-radius: 999px; border: 3px solid #93c5fd; background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.17); transform-origin: 7px 50%; }
#game .sg-arm-a { left: 1px; transform: rotate(23deg); }
#game .sg-arm-b { left: 53px; transform: rotate(147deg); }
#game .sg-legs { position: absolute; left: 36px; top: 101px; width: 42px; height: 72px; border-left: 4px solid #60a5fa; border-right: 4px solid #60a5fa; border-radius: 0 0 12px 12px; transform: rotate(3deg); }
#game .sg-target { position: absolute; z-index: 3; width: clamp(82px, 24%, 116px); height: clamp(66px, 20%, 96px); transform: translate(-50%, -50%); border: 3px dashed rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.95); border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.13); box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.07), 0 0 24px rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.28); pointer-events: none; }
#game .sg-target::before { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 27%; border: 2px solid rgba(187, 247, 208, 0.7); border-radius: 50%; }
#game .sg-target-label { position: absolute; left: 50%; bottom: -27px; transform: translateX(-50%); white-space: nowrap; padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 999px; color: #bbf7d0; background: rgba(20, 83, 45, 0.76); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; }
#game .sg-guide { position: absolute; z-index: 2; left: 53%; top: 38%; width: 45px; height: 3px; transform: rotate(-42deg); transform-origin: 100% 50%; border-radius: 999px; background: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(253, 186, 116, 0.78) 0 7px, transparent 7px 13px); pointer-events: none; opacity: 0.8; }
#game .sg-guide::before { content: ""; position: absolute; left: -2px; top: -5px; width: 10px; height: 10px; border-left: 3px solid #fdba74; border-bottom: 3px solid #fdba74; transform: rotate(45deg); }
#game .sg-ball { position: absolute; z-index: 5; left: 58%; top: 44%; width: 48px; height: 48px; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); border-radius: 50%; cursor: grab; touch-action: none; background: radial-gradient(circle at 34% 28%, #ffcf82 0 8%, #f59e0b 9% 48%, #c96b08 72%, #8a3d05 100%); border: 3px solid #7c2d12; box-shadow: 0 7px 16px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.4), inset -5px -6px 10px rgba(120, 53, 15, 0.34); }
#game .sg-ball::before { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 21px; top: 2px; width: 3px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(87, 35, 7, 0.82); transform: rotate(28deg); }
#game .sg-ball::after { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 3px; top: 20px; width: 38px; height: 3px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(87, 35, 7, 0.82); transform: rotate(-12deg); }
